## Incident Summary

[One to two sentences describing what was found and where.]
In this incident, the Maplewood SOC monitoring system generated an alert for an unexpected file modification on MHS-C3-NRS-07.
The alert was triggered at 6:45am. A file named "patient_notes.txt' appeared in the home directory of the workstation's user account
at 3:14am. Attached to the file is an "execute" permission bit set which is unusual for a ".txt" file and needs to be investigated further.

