## Escalation Recommendation

[State whether you would escalate, identify the strongest evidence, and note at least one question that still requires Tier 2 investigation.]

I would most definitley escalate this finding to a Tier 2 and the strongest evidence that supports this decision is the "patient_notes.txt" file
having an execute permission bit. It could potentially be disguised as something more malicious. One question that requires Tier 2 investigation 
is "Is the file disguised as something else, if so what is in that file?" 

